<title>USA: American Tire to buy UTI Chemicals.</title>
<headline>American Tire to buy UTI Chemicals.</headline>
<dateline>RAVENNA, Ohio 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Tire Corp said on Thursday it signed a contract to acquire  UTI Chemicals (Europe) Ltd for $2 million in cash and stock.</p>
<p>UTI is a British-based distributor of specialty tires in Europe. American plans to use it to distribute its own specialty tires in those markets.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
